==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 7.33 seconds<sup>220f</sup>, delay 20~22 seconds<sup>600f~660f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~22 seconds<sup>600f~660f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Berserkory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] completely nullifies this stage, being able to block Berserkory's waves and being [[Resistant]] against Bun Bun Symbiote. Bring any good [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] units ([[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp/Roe Cat]]) and any good [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Aliens]] ([[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway/Seafarer Cat]] and [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]]). Use standard meatshields stall the Doge Darks for money, and when the bosses spawn, lure and try to take care of the Bun Bun Symbiote first. [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] helps immensely with this, doing [[Massive Damage]] to Symbiote while he's frozen by Seafarer.

